====== TP-Link TD-W8970 v3.0======

TD-W8970 v3.0 is a Broadcom 300Mbps Wireless N Gigabit ADSL2+ Modem Router.

Previous versions are Lantiq based; use the [[toh:tp-link:td-w8970_v1|TD-W8970 v1.x page]] as a reference.

{{media:tplink:td-w8970:td-w8970-v3.png?250|TD-W8970 v3.0}}


